\"/><figcaption>AI強勢下，7大行業仍有將來！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"AI強勢下，7大行業仍有將來！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980818852919250944531786.jpeg/7OulmsuPdWZ7UUoC9rwnfHot0vxMMflzJZ0gcCWdIHA\"/><figcaption>AI強勢下，7大行業仍有將來！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"AI強勢下，7大行業仍有將來！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980818855184306176207963.jpeg/tEk4dkQa5ch26dDgu83TM0qD96zyHvMWkpQiKJKUIig\"/><figcaption>AI強勢下，7大行業仍有將來！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"AI強勢下，7大行業仍有將來！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980818857105428480983760.jpeg/83biYOal9PTca0lqtX4shRBPoGhlROlot04irrdOIq4\"/><figcaption>AI強勢下，7大行業仍有將來！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>「活Google」請假全公司慌了！他曝同事太萬能 網搖頭：別做這種人</p><p>月薪3.4萬找「短影音全才」！每月最多出片120支 徵才方：草莓族勿試</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-21T04:18:42.689593+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":3105,"images":64,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}